{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用回溯从当前位置枚举所有非空前缀，只有前缀是回文串时，才把它加入当前方案并继续处理剩余字符。示例 \"aab\" 中，路径先得到 [\"a\",\"a\",\"b\"]，回退后再选择 \"aa\"，得到 [\"aa\",\"b\"]；\"aab\" 与 \"ab\" 因不是回文串而被剪枝。到达字符串末尾时记录方案，回退则撤销最近一次选择。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>分割回文串可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.hint{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.mono,.char,.piece,.answer{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.string-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}\n.char{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.index{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}\n.role{font-size:10px;min-height:12px;margin-top:1px}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.badge strong{color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.path{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-height:28px}\n.piece{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-size:11px}\n.empty{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:11px}\n.candidate{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;margin-top:8px}\n.candidate.ok{border-color:#3794ff}\n.candidate.no{border-color:#f14c4c}\n.candidate-label{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.candidate-value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;margin:2px 0}\n.reason{font-size:10px;line-height:1.4}\n.ok .reason{color:#8d8d8d}.no .reason{color:#f48771}\n.answers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.answer{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;opacity:.45;font-size:10px;transition:opacity .35s,background .35s}\n.answer.found{opacity:1;background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.tree{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.node{padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;background:#2d2d2d;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.node.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.node.cut{border-color:#f14c4c;color:#f48771}\n.footer{margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.step-title{font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\n.step-note{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>回溯 s = <span class=\"mono\">\"aab\"</span></h1>\n<div class=\"hint\">蓝格为当前候选子串。</div>\n<div class=\"string-row\" id=\"cells\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"></div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"badge\">起点 <strong id=\"start\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\">终点 <strong id=\"end\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\">动作 <strong id=\"action\">开始</strong></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">当前路径</div>\n<div class=\"path\" id=\"path\"></div>\n<div class=\"candidate\" id=\"candidate\">\n<div class=\"candidate-label\">检查</div>\n<div class=\"candidate-value\" id=\"candidateValue\">—</div>\n<div class=\"reason\" id=\"reason\">从第 0 个字符开始枚举前缀</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tree\" id=\"tree\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">答案</div>\n<div class=\"answers\">\n<div class=\"answer\" id=\"ans1\">[\"a\", \"a\", \"b\"]</div>\n<div class=\"answer\" id=\"ans2\">[\"aa\", \"b\"]</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"step-title\" id=\"stepTitle\">准备搜索</div>\n<div class=\"step-note\" id=\"stepNote\">选回文前缀后递归剩余部分。</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"footer\">回文：两端向中间比较；到末尾则保存路径。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst chars=['a','a','b'];\nconst steps=[],selected=[],answers=[];\nconst text=chars.join('');\nfunction save(range,cand,ok,start,end,action,note){steps.push({range,path:[...selected],cand,ok,start,end,action,title:action,note,nodes:[...selected],answers:answers.length})}\nfunction palindrome(s){let l=0,r=s.length-1;while(l<r)if(s[l++]!==s[r--])return false;return true}\nfunction visit(start){\n if(start===text.length){answers.push([...selected]);save(null,'完整路径',true,start,start,'记录答案','到达字符串末尾, 保存 ['+selected.join(', ')+'].');return}\n for(let end=start;end<text.length;end++){\n  const part=text.slice(start,end+1),ok=palindrome(part);\n  save([start,end],part,ok,start,end,ok?'检查候选':'剪枝',ok?'两端向中间比较通过, 准备加入当前路径.':'两端不匹配, 不进入这一分支.');\n  if(!ok)continue;\n  selected.push(part);save([start,end],part,true,start,end,'选择','把 '+part+' 加入路径, 从下标 '+(end+1)+' 递归.');\n  visit(end+1);\n  selected.pop();save(null,'撤销 '+part,true,start,end,'回溯','撤销末尾 '+part+', 恢复上层路径, 继续枚举更长前缀.');\n }\n}\nvisit(0);save(null,'完成',true,0,text.length-1,'结束','全部候选已经检查, 共 '+answers.length+' 个方案.');\nconst cells=document.getElementById('cells');\nchars.forEach((c,i)=>{cells.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class=\"cell\" data-i=\"${i}\"><div class=\"char\">${c}</div><div class=\"index\">${i}</div><div class=\"role\">未处理</div></div>`)});\nfunction render(s,idx){\n document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach((el,i)=>{\n  el.className='cell';\n  const role=el.querySelector('.role');\n  if(s.range&&i>=s.range[0]&&i<=s.range[1]){el.classList.add('active');role.textContent='候选'}\n  else if(i<s.start){el.classList.add('done');role.textContent='已选'}\n  else role.textContent='未处理';\n });\n document.getElementById('start').textContent=s.start;\n document.getElementById('end').textContent=s.end;\n document.getElementById('action').textContent=s.action;\n const path=document.getElementById('path');\n path.innerHTML=s.path.length?s.path.map((x,i)=>`${i?'<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>':''}<span class=\"piece\">${x}</span>`).join(''):'<span class=\"empty\">路径为空</span>';\n const box=document.getElementById('candidate');\n box.className='candidate '+(s.ok?'ok':'no');\n document.getElementById('candidateValue').textContent=s.cand;\n document.getElementById('reason').textContent=s.action==='结束'?'全部分支已枚举, 无需继续搜索':s.action==='回溯'?'已恢复上层路径, 继续枚举':s.ok?(s.action==='记录答案'?'已覆盖整个字符串，可以保存':'回文检查通过，可以向下搜索'):'回文检查失败，立即剪枝';\n document.getElementById('stepTitle').textContent=s.title;\n document.getElementById('stepNote').textContent=s.note;\n document.getElementById('tree').innerHTML=s.nodes.map((n,i)=>`<span class=\"node ${s.cut&&i===s.nodes.length-1?'cut':'on'}\">${n}</span>`).join('');\n document.getElementById('ans1').className='answer '+((s.answers||0)>=1?'found':'');\n document.getElementById('ans2').className='answer '+((s.answers||0)>=2?'found':'');\n document.getElementById('progress').style.width=((idx+1)/steps.length*100)+'%';\n}\nlet current=0;render(steps[current],current);\nsetInterval(()=>{current=(current+1)%steps.length;render(steps[current],current)},2100);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
